From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dan Lapid <dlapid@cloudflare.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0000
Subject: Gate RacyDecodeEmbeddedFeedback's DISABLE_TSAN on THREAD_SANITIZER

RacyDecodeEmbeddedFeedback is the only place in V8 where DISABLE_TSAN
is gated behind V8_IS_TSAN, so a TSan build without V8_IS_TSAN loses
it. Gate it on THREAD_SANITIZER instead, which such a build still
defines.

diff --git a/src/interpreter/bytecode-decoder.cc b/src/interpreter/bytecode-decoder.cc
--- a/src/interpreter/bytecode-decoder.cc
+++ b/src/interpreter/bytecode-decoder.cc
@@ -75,7 +75,7 @@ uint32_t BytecodeDecoder::DecodeUnsignedOperand(Address operand_start,
 }
 
 // static
-#ifdef V8_IS_TSAN
+#ifdef THREAD_SANITIZER
 V8_NOINLINE
 
 DISABLE_TSAN
